Open Resin Slicer Service is an independent Workpiece wrapper around unmodified/pinned upstream tools.
PrusaSlicer: https://github.com/prusa3d/PrusaSlicer (GNU AGPL v3)
UVtools: https://github.com/sn4k3/UVtools (GNU AGPL v3)

This scaffold does not include or modify upstream source code. Container builds fetch pinned upstream source/binaries.
